{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm","lean:module:QOU.Infra.DirichletL","lean:module:QOU.Infra.Clausen"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.LValueDecomposition.full_decomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.LValueDecomposition.full_decomposition","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.lean#L64-L64","doc":"The full chain β(3) = L(χ_4, 3) = Im Li_3(i) = π³ / 32. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.LValueDecomposition.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.LValueDecomposition.mk","kind":"ctor","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.lean#L62-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.LValueDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.LValueDecomposition","kind":"class","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.lean#L47-L64","doc":"**Conditional-class wrapper for the full L-value decomposition.**\n\nRecords the manuscript claim\n\n  `β(3) = L(χ_4, 3) = Im Li_3(i) = π³ / 32`\n\nvia the full chain (1) Theorem A → (2) β(3) Dirichlet series →\n(3) Hurwitz-Lerch decomposition → (4) L(χ, n) identification.\n\nSteps (2)-(4) are conjectural-class content (require Mathlib\n`Polylogarithm` / `DirichletL` infrastructure not yet\navailable); step (1) is the verified `beta_3_from_jonquiere`\nabove.  Downstream propositions taking\n`[LValueDecomposition]` as a hypothesis become rigorous\nconditional results per AGENTS.md §3b-cond. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.beta_3_from_jonquiere","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.beta_3_from_jonquiere","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CyclotomicLValueDecomposition.lean#L34-L45","doc":"**Theorem (`prop:cyclotomic-l-value-decomposition`,\narithmetic core).**\n\n`lean.ref` alias for the manuscript's\n`prop:cyclotomic-l-value-decomposition` block.  Forwards to\nthe canonical proof in `QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm`\n(`beta3_from_jonquiere`) to avoid duplicating the\narithmetic identity.  Per Gemini review:\ncentral utility goes in the infra module; chapter modules\nforward. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:cyclotomic-l-value-decomposition","label":"prop:cyclotomic-l-value-decomposition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/cyclotomic-l-value-decomposition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}